 "emoji": "🪦",
 "sentences": [
  "This massive arch was actually a backup plan.",
  "The first design by architect Sir Edwin Lutyens was canceled due to a lack of money.",
  "A committee then asked Lutyens for a new memorial arch in 1923.",
  "It is a 21-meter tall structure made of Portland stone.",
  "The design features four arched openings in a tetrapylon shape.",
  "On 11 November, the sunrise shines directly through the main arches."
